      "en": "“Let the day perish in which I was born, the night which said, ‘There is a boy conceived.’",
      "ko": "나의 난 날이 멸망하였었더라면, 남아를 배었다 하던 그 밤도 그러하였었더라면,",
      "source_text_hash": "0a6b0ccee021880b8236cc8ba646e8958820341d3fe814952963a40834f59a41",
      "translation_text_hash": "578bb0113ace8b0a3775fe1b42a46730a17e91999481fb1e75c68c3ea0d5ca02",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
