      "en": "Let them curse it who curse the day, who are ready to rouse up leviathan.",
      "ko": "날을 저주하는 자 곧 큰 악어를 격동시키기에 익숙한 자가 그 밤을 저주하였었더라면,",
      "source_text_hash": "82c745c73ce492cd66e14fdabf5b8ba88d7c73dfc87a414ca1b11b0589fd4393",
      "translation_text_hash": "22ed4d55247b9b0e6bd98b170bea4bf5a055304e93b14f1150e7d636279a1cdc",
